{"id":"8c66d3576ff86914","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-cohesive.md","title":"相对于 c.e. 集合的 cohesive 集","display":"df-cohesive — 相对于 c.e. 集合的 cohesive 集","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-cohesive","aliases":["20-df-cohesive"],"display":"df-cohesive — 相对于 c.e. 集合的 cohesive 集","chapter":"supplement","section":"supplement.ce-lattice","source_kind":"local-supplement","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"本地补充定义","depends_on":["[[20-df-re]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-cohesive"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-cohesive</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-cohesive — 相对于 c.e. 集合的 cohesive 集"},{"key":"chapter","html":"supplement"},{"key":"section","html":"supplement.ce-lattice"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"local-supplement"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"本地补充定义"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(C\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cohesive}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Cohesive}(C)\\Longleftrightarrow\n|C|=\\omega\\land\\forall e\\\n[|C\\cap W_e|&lt;\\omega\\lor|C\\setminus W_e|&lt;\\omega].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cohesive}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Cohesive}(C)\\Longleftrightarrow\n|C|=\\omega\\land\\forall e\\\n[|C\\cap W_e|&lt;\\omega\\lor|C\\setminus W_e|&lt;\\omega].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>C 不要求 c.e.。每个 c.e. 集合几乎包含 C 或几乎避开 C。对全部可计算集合的类似条件是 r-cohesive，不能直接替代此量化范围。</p>\n<p>来源：本地补充定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-re]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-re]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"C\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cohesive}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Cohesive}(C)\\Longleftrightarrow\n|C|=\\omega\\land\\forall e\\\n[|C\\cap W_e|<\\omega\\lor|C\\setminus W_e|<\\omega].","display":true}],"bytes":940,"backlinks":[{"id":"27476a93ed7d19d4","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-cohesive]]。"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-440","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-cohesive]] — 章 supplement；直接提供者 1 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-440","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-cohesive]]"}],"outgoing":["60af447f5d59a8dc"]}